[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2832427146","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105790#issuecomment-2832427146","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105790","id":2832427146,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6o02iK","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-26T16:46:48Z","updated_at":"2025-04-26T16:46:48Z","body":"Not everyone uses blender style. I believe we support maya-style and modo style.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2832427146/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2832445774","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105790#issuecomment-2832445774","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105790","id":2832445774,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6o07FO","user":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-26T17:11:13Z","updated_at":"2025-04-26T17:11:13Z","body":">Not everyone uses blender style. I believe we support maya-style and modo style.\r\n\r\nThis PR is meant to avoid conflict with all navigation schemes including custom ones. The blender-style was referring to the shortcuts meant to initiate transforms. I don't believe other software use `alt` to initiate transforms. That was something I included in the reference PR to not break compatibility too much, but it comes with its own problems which already has alternative solutions.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2832445774/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2832480435","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105790#issuecomment-2832480435","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105790","id":2832480435,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6o1Diz","user":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-26T17:49:50Z","updated_at":"2025-04-26T17:50:06Z","body":"Something that may help is to add a `Begin Tool Mode Transformation` shortcut which automatically does the transform of the selected tool mode. Then the users don't have to bind a key for every type of transform. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2832480435/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3028199269","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105790#issuecomment-3028199269","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105790","id":3028199269,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60fqdl","user":{"login":"Lateasusual","id":24512254,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NTEyMjU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24512254?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lateasusual","html_url":"https://github.com/Lateasusual","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lateasusual/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lateasusual/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lateasusual/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lateasusual/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lateasusual/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lateasusual/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lateasusual/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lateasusual/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lateasusual/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-02T14:57:33Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T14:57:33Z","body":"I think a better solution would be to allow #87756 to be disabled, as this would remove the need to hold Alt in the first place :)\r\n\r\nI think it's a bad design to require setting up custom key bindings just to use the transform tools as transform tools, and is an endless source of frustration for new users. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3028199269/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3028322858","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105790#issuecomment-3028322858","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105790","id":3028322858,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60gIoq","user":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-02T15:33:43Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T15:57:44Z","body":"There are several reasons why most (if not all) 3D software do not transform things by default when clicking anywhere on the viewport.\r\n\r\n- It would reintroduce: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/87608\r\n\r\n- It would make functionality like https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102176 a lot less intuitive since you'll have to constantly switch modes, and I believe a lot of future functionality will depend on this one, such as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106835\r\n\r\n- There are already proven solutions to this that I believe should just not be custom: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/78148 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11926\r\n\r\nIn my opinion we should promote intuitive and less error-prone solutions as a priority rather than providing maximum flexibility to accommodate every possible workflow. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3028322858/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3028634210","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105790#issuecomment-3028634210","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105790","id":3028634210,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60hUpi","user":{"login":"Lateasusual","id":24512254,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NTEyMjU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24512254?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lateasusual","html_url":"https://github.com/Lateasusual","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lateasusual/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lateasusual/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lateasusual/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lateasusual/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lateasusual/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lateasusual/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lateasusual/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lateasusual/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lateasusual/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-02T17:15:09Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T17:16:21Z","body":"Sorry, I think i should have worded this better. My point was more that until something like #78148 is made the default, this leaves the UI in a fairly unusable state for many users unless they manually add those keybinds and it functionally removes several modes of interaction - it's no longer possible to e.g. translate in the camera plane on multiple axes simultaneously, or to rotate an object around the view axis, as there are currently no gizmos for that. \r\n\r\nI don't disagree that the current behaviour is \"bad\", but i don't think it'd be good to merge changes like this until an alternative is in place","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3028634210/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3028882770","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105790#issuecomment-3028882770","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105790","id":3028882770,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60iRVS","user":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-02T18:18:02Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T18:18:14Z","body":">it's no longer possible to e.g. translate in the camera plane on multiple axes simultaneously, or to rotate an object around the view axis, as there are currently no gizmos for that.\r\n\r\nIf I am understanding correctly, this is possible by dragging the selected object. If it's a `VisualInstance3D` that would be any of the visual geometry. If it's something like a `Camera3D`, it would be the camera gizmo. I can take your point in some other examples like an empty `Node3D`, might be worth making a separate issue, although I think the solution would still be adding some default bindings. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3028882770/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]